265
00:30:20,700 --> 00:30:25,877
And then when I woke up I was in the Speed

266
00:30:25,960 --> 00:30:28,540
Wagon Foundation's paramedic helicopter.

267
00:30:30,900 --> 00:30:32,240
Through my comrades'

268
00:30:32,540 --> 00:30:38,760
battle, and a blood transfusion from Dio's
remains, yes, I was able to be revived.

269
00:30:39,220 --> 00:30:45,000
I owe it all to my grandson, and to the
precious lives that can never be restored.

270
00:30:45,460 --> 00:30:49,720
The terrifying evil is now
disappearing into the Red Sea,

271
00:30:50,020 --> 00:30:52,600
along with the shimmer of the morning sun.

272
00:30:53,720 --> 00:31:00,280
As long as I live, I will never
forget about this journey, this site.

273
00:31:12,980 --> 00:31:15,697
And Kakyoin,

274
00:31:15,780 --> 00:31:20,600
Iggy, Avdol,

275
00:31:20,800 --> 00:31:24,540
it's over.

276
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:41,160
Why do you insist on going
back to France, Polnareff?

277
00:31:42,320 --> 00:31:44,880
You don't have any family there, right?

278
00:31:45,240 --> 00:31:47,080
So why not come to my place?

279
00:31:47,380 --> 00:31:48,380
Come to New York.

280
00:31:52,320 --> 00:31:53,150
Mr.

281
00:31:53,233 --> 00:31:56,646
Joestar, although I have no family
left, France is my homeland.

282
00:31:58,060 --> 00:31:59,800
I think often of my hometown.

283
00:32:00,280 --> 00:32:03,633
No matter where I go, it is
the place I always return to.

284
00:32:04,100 --> 00:32:05,640
Don't hesitate to call me.

285
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:07,588
I'll come as fast as I can.

286
00:32:08,380 --> 00:32:11,204
From anywhere in the world
I might happen to be.

287
00:32:11,860 --> 00:32:13,660
Well, I'll certainly miss you.

288
00:32:18,040 --> 00:32:20,687
We had many painful and
difficult situations.

289
00:32:21,800 --> 00:32:24,388
But I wouldn't have
missed it for the world.

290
00:32:25,040 --> 00:32:27,922
Because of all of you,
the journey was enjoyable.

291
00:32:31,620 --> 00:32:33,117
Yes, that's true.

292
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:36,800
I enjoyed it as well, from
the bottom of my heart.

293
00:32:57,480 --> 00:32:58,337
I'll see you later.

294
00:32:58,420 --> 00:33:00,197
Try not to get yourself killed!

295
00:33:00,280 --> 00:33:01,339
You hear, old man?

296
00:33:03,000 --> 00:33:04,529
You and your damn grandson

297
00:33:05,100 --> 00:33:07,218
Don't you two forget about me, okay?

298
00:33:08,520 --> 00:33:09,857
We'll see you again.

299
00:33:09,940 --> 00:33:12,780
Unless you try to steer
clear of me, that is!

300
00:33:13,320 --> 00:33:14,180
Right then.

301
00:33:14,840 --> 00:33:15,670
Farewell.

302
00:33:17,180 --> 00:33:19,617
Nobody could ever forget a guy like you!

303
00:33:19,700 --> 00:33:21,465
Even if they really wanted to.

304
00:33:24,260 --> 00:33:25,360
Take care now.

305
00:33:45,560 --> 00:33:47,640
Mama, Mama, wake up!

306
00:33:48,520 --> 00:33:49,350
Holly!

307
00:33:49,900 --> 00:33:51,540
Why, why, you're...

308
00:33:52,160 --> 00:33:53,340
You're awake!

309
00:33:54,020 --> 00:33:55,432
Are you feeling alright?

310
00:33:56,100 --> 00:33:56,930
Yes.

311
00:33:57,240 --> 00:34:00,240
All of a sudden, I just
feel completely fine again.

312
00:34:00,760 --> 00:34:03,340
In any case, we have to get ready. Huh?

313
00:34:04,280 --> 00:34:05,927
They'll be coming home soon.

314
00:34:06,620 --> 00:34:07,600
Papa and Jotaro.

315
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:11,400
I know it, Mama. Very soon.

316
00:34:11,620 --> 00:34:13,640
They'll be coming home at last.

317
00:36:05,780 --> 00:36:07,120
Thank you.
